    "title": "Mohawk Valley Community College Home",
    "headings": [
      "At MVCC, you belong.",
      "Apply now and become part of our community!",
      "Headlines",
      "Events",
      "Adults can attend MVCC for free through SUNY Reconnect",
      "Educational Opportunity Program (EOP)",
      "MVCC Microcredentials",
      "Testimonials from Our Alumni",
      "\"I couldn't be prouder of how my journey started at MVCC. It gave me the foundation to lead, to belong, succeed, and grow.\"",
      "\"MVCC didn't just prepare me for a job – it prepared me for a future in a growing and sustainable industry.\"",
      "\"I'm thankful that MVCC has helped me get to this point in my career and my business.\"",
      "\"My favorite things about MVCC were being around all my fellow photography peers and growing my toolbox of design skills.\"",
      "\"The teachers at MVCC are always willing to go above and beyond to help you succeed. Without them, I wouldn't be where I am today.\"",
      "\"I'm grateful to MVCC for showing me what I am capable of and guiding me to the career path that I'm dedicated to today.\"",
      "\"MVCC truly changed the trajectory of my life. I don't know where I'd be without a college degree.\"",
      "\"MVCC taught me technical skills and proper procedures for safety – as well as making things look pretty.\"",
      "Our Social Media Updates"
    ],
